 154| - No process-alive in-TTL session; no continue/coach; leftover resume-token after terminal result is not D3.
 155| - Unlikely to hit interactive-only UI (no “use the TUI to approve”).
 156| - Parent does not need to steer after submit.
 157| 
 158| **Tie-break:** NI (cheaper), unless D3 session rule fired.
