]` contains `fallback_drop:<flag>` for each (I-61); auto `--attach`/`--control-dir` (and `SB_AGENT_MODE_ATTACH`) classified interactive + TUI miss → NI `tui-unavailable` plus `fallback_drop:<flag>` for each dropped flag, not `attach-on-ni`/`control-dir-on-ni` (I-66); NI `session.json` may omit `turns`/`wave_started_at` (I-58).
