# Rung 4 review — GLM 5.3 Max (OpenCode)

**Plan:** [agent_interaction_modes_17ed9bf7.plan.md](/Users/shafqat/projects/silver-bullet/repo/.cursor/plans/agent_interaction_modes_17ed9bf7.plan.md)

